      "text": "- lowercase, strip punctuation, collapse whitespace\n\n- legal-suffix map (Ltd/Limited, Pvt/Private,\nCorp/Corporation, & vs \"and\")\n\n- address-abbrev map (Rd/Road, St/Street)\n\n- keep BOTH raw and normalized columns (A/B test\nwhich helps blocking)",
