      "text": "- baseline: Logistic Regression, class_weight=\"balanced\"\n\n- iterate: Random Forest / XGBoost / LightGBM (CPU is fine at this\nscale - no GPU needed for classical gradient boosting)\n\n- [optional, Colab GPU] only if a neural/embedding-based matcher is\nadded",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- baseline: Logistic Regression, class_weight=\"balanced\"\n\n- iterate: Random Forest / XGBoost / LightGBM (CPU is fine at this scale - no GPU needed for classical gradient boosting)\n\n- [optional, Colab GPU] only if a neural/embedding-based matcher is added",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
